motion: Slow aerial glide above the river delta toward the distant town; palm fronds sway and thin smoke drifts with the wind, no sudden camera movement. Motion direction: 6–10 seconds, 16:9 cinematic historical realism, smooth deliberate camera movement, natural water/wind/cloth motion, stable faces and anatomy, no morphing, no sudden new objects, no text, no watermark, no modern objects, non-graphic. Preserve late-18th-century southern Vietnamese visual continuity and the same Nguyễn Ánh character reference.

